# MARLEY reaction data for neutral current vx on 56Fe
#
# B(M1) scattering data was taken from T. Shizuma, et al., Phys. Rev. C87 (2013)
# gamma,gamma' scattering data to 10 MeV. Above 10 MeV, the shell model calculations
# in that paper using the GXPF1J interaction were used. These values were then
# converted to B(GT_0) following the procedure in O. G. Ryazhskaya and S. V. Semenov,
# Physics of Atomic Nuclei, 81 (2018),
# B(GT_0) = ( 4 pi (g_A)^2 B(M1) ) / ( 3 (mu_v)^2 (mu_N)^2 ),
# assuming g_A=1.26, mu_v = 4.706.
#
# Particle IDs and final ion charge
# 10LZZZAAAI
2 1000260560
